# Undergrowth Recon: the trigger needs a land card in Bot1's graveyard to target (CR 603.3d). Turn 3's upkeep finds the graveyard
# empty; on turn 3 Thought Scour (Mox Sapphire) mills Lightning Bolt and Counterspell, nonland cards, so turn 5's upkeep finds
# only those: the trigger is put on the stack neither time and the Bolt and the Counterspell stay where they are.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Undergrowth Recon
Mox Sapphire
Thought Scour
Island
Island
Island
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Swamp
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Undergrowth Recon.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Thought Scour; Counterspell; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0
[Expect]
Turn = 5
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Thought Scour; Counterspell; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
